              "text": "मच्छरदाणी — macchardāṇī — \"a mosquito net\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "डास खूप होते, म्हणून आम्ही मच्छरदाणी लावली. ḍās khūp hote, mhaṇūn āmhī macchardāṇī lāvlī. There were lots of mosquitoes, so we put up a mosquito net."
            },
